# Only the two required renderer files enter this Docker build context.
# All API source, PostgreSQL adapters, client assets, .env and keys are excluded.
**
!infra/
!infra/hyperframes-staging/
!infra/hyperframes-staging/static-renderer.Dockerfile
!infra/hyperframes-staging/static-renderer-standalone.cjs
!infra/hyperframes-staging/chrome-headless-wrapper.sh
